<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Ascend Communications Inc and added it to the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Ascend gained 3-11/16 to 51-11/16.</p>
